request.description:
Mengambil **detail lengkap** satu order.

**Auto-receive:** Jika status order `shipped` dan kurir mengonfirmasi delivered, order otomatis diupdate ke `received`.

**Response Structure:**
```json
{
  "shipping": {
    "courier": "jne",
    "tracking_number": "JNE123456",
    "status": "Paket telah diterima oleh...",
    "delivered_at": "2026-03-15T14:00:00Z"
  },
  "recipient": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "phone": "08123456789",
    "address": {
      "street": "Jl. Merdeka No. 1",
      "district": "Menteng",
      "city": "Jakarta",
      "province": "DKI Jakarta",
      "postal_code": "10110"
    }
  },
  "store": {
    "name": "Toko Umroh"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Sajadah Premium",
      "variant": "Hijau - L",
      "price": 150000,
      "quantity": 2,
      "subtotal": 300000
    }
  ],
  "payment": {
    "method": "QRIS",
    "total_amount": 320000
  },
  "order": {
    "order_number": "ORD-20260311-XXXX",
    "order_time": "2026-03-11T10:00:00Z",
    "payment_time": "2026-03-11T10:05:00Z",
    "shipping_time": "2026-03-12T08:00:00Z",
    "delivered_time": null
  },
  "summary": {
    "items_total": 300000,
    "shipping_fee": 8000,
    "service_fee": 12000,
    "grand_total": 320000
  }
}
```

**Mengambil nota pesanan** (invoice data).

**Note:** `invoice_number` menggunakan `external_invoice_id` dari Xendit jika tersedia, kalau tidak fallback ke `order_no`.

**Response Structure:**
```json
{
  "invoice": {
    "invoice_number": "INV-ODR-242727",
    "issued_at": "2025-01-04 15:36",
    "actions": {
      "can_copy": true,
      "can_print": true,
      "can_download": true
    }
  },
  "customer": {
    "name": "Safira Anaya",
    "phone": "+6281234567890",
    "address": {
      "street": "Gg. Sanusi",
      "district": "Kec. Cianjur",
      "city": "Kabupaten Cianjur",
      "province": "Jawa Barat",
      "postal_code": "267281"
    }
  },
  "payment": {
    "method": "QRIS",
    "paid_at": "2026-01-01 06:00"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Paket Oleh-oleh Umrah Keluarga",
      "variant": "Keluarga Besar",
      "price": 450000,
      "quantity": 1,
      "subtotal": 450000,
      "image_url": null
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "subtotal": 450000,
    "shipping_fee": 15000,
    "service_fee": 2500,
    "total": 467500,
    "currency": "IDR"
  }
}
```

**Mengambil informasi pengiriman** dengan timeline tracking.

**Auto-receive:** Jika status order `shipped` dan kurir mengonfirmasi delivered, order otomatis diupdate ke `received`.

**Dynamic Stages:** Stage sekarang di-infer dari deskripsi event tracking terbaru (misal: "dikirim ke alamat" → in_transit stage active).

**Response Structure:**
```json
{
  "estimated_arrival": "2026-03-15",
  "stages": [
    {"status": "processing", "label": "Diproses", "completed": true, "active": false},
    {"status": "shipped", "label": "Dikirim", "completed": true, "active": false},
    {"status": "in_transit", "label": "Dalam Perjalanan", "completed": false, "active": true},
    {"status": "delivered", "label": "Tiba di Tujuan", "completed": false, "active": false}
  ],
  "courier": {
    "name": "J&T Express",
    "code": "jnt",
    "tracking_no": "JT272936382"
  },
  "events": [
    {
      "date_time": "2026-03-12 10:30",
      "description": "Paket diterima di gudang Cianjur",
      "location": "CIANJUR"
    },
    {
      "date_time": "2026-03-12 08:00",
      "description": "Paket dalam perjalanan ke hub berikutnya",
      "location": "BANDUNG"
    }
  ]
}
```

